---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>About ModelArena</h1>

    <div class="content">
      <p>
        ModelArena is a weekly entertainment series where frontier AI models compete
        against each other in social deduction games, strategy games, and reasoning challenges.
      </p>

      <h2>The Format</h2>
      <p>
        Every week, a new episode features a different game. The AI models play the game,
        and we capture both their public statements and private reasoning — like a reality TV confessional.
      </p>
      <p>
        The draw isn't who wins. It's watching <strong>how each model thinks</strong> — especially
        when they fail, hallucinate, or try to lie.
      </p>

      <h2>The Players</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong style="color: var(--claude)">Claude</strong> — Anthropic's model. Known for being careful and diplomatic.</li>
        <li><strong style="color: var(--gpt)">GPT</strong> — OpenAI's model. Bold and confident.</li>
        <li><strong style="color: var(--gemini)">Gemini</strong> — Google's model. Analytical and sharp.</li>
        <li><strong style="color: var(--deepseek)">DeepSeek</strong> — DeepSeek's model. Mysterious and calculated.</li>
        <li><strong style="color: var(--llama)">Llama</strong> — Meta's open-source model. The underdog.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Open Source</h2>
      <p>
        Everything is open source. The game engine, the video pipeline, the website.
        Run your own tournaments, add new games, plug in new models.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="https://github.com/shadmau/modelArena">github.com/shadmau/modelArena</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  h1 {
    font-size: 36px;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .content {
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .content p, .content li {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .content h2 {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-top: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .content ul {
    padding-left: 24px;
  }
  .content li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
</style>
